      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1920,
      "text": "Allah knows all that you conceal and all that you reveal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1921,
      "text": "But those whom they invoke besides Allah do not create anything; rather, they themselves are created.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1922,
      "text": "They are dead, not living[12]; not even knowing when they will be resurrected.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1923,
      "text": "Your God is One God. But those who do not believe in the Hereafter, their hearts refuse to know, and they are arrogant[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 226,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1924,
      "text": "Undoubtedly, Allah knows what they conceal and what they reveal[14]. Indeed, He does not like those who are arrogant.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 14,
