      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 226,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1925,
      "text": "When it is said to them, “What has your Lord sent down?” They say, “Ancient fables!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 269,
      "ruku": 226,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1926,
      "text": "They will bear their burdens in full on the Day of Resurrection and some burdens of those whom they misled without knowledge[15]. How terrible is what they will bear!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
